"                         │      └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘        "
"                         │  A session whose account hits a limit rotates to the account of the      "
"                         │  same provider with the most room left, on the same model, unless        "
"                         │  sessions are pinned. A fallback account is used only once every other   "
"                         │  one of its provider is at its limit or logged out. Pinning is set in    "
"                         │  the machine's daemon config ([failover] pin).                           "
